@startuml classes_conceitual
title MiniPar 2026.2 - Modelo conceitual (compilador + runtime)

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam defaultFontName Monospaced
skinparam nodesep 22
skinparam ranksep 38
left to right direction
hide empty members

skinparam class {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #444444
  ArrowColor #555555
  FontSize 12
}
skinparam class<<orquestracao>> {
  BackgroundColor #E8F0FE
  BorderColor #35507A
}
skinparam class<<frontend>> {
  BackgroundColor #E6F4EA
  BorderColor #2E7D4F
}
skinparam class<<backend>> {
  BackgroundColor #FFF4E5
  BorderColor #A66A1F
}
skinparam class<<runtime>> {
  BackgroundColor #F4ECF7
  BorderColor #6B4C8A
}
skinparam class<<contrato>> {
  BackgroundColor #FFF8DC
  BorderColor #B8860B
}
skinparam class<<artefato>> {
  BackgroundColor #F2F2F2
  BorderColor #777777
}

package "1. Orquestracao" {
  class CompiladorMiniPar <<orquestracao>> {
    +compile_file(source, output) : bool
  }
  interface IControle <<contrato>> {
    +compile(source, output) : bool
  }
  class CControle <<orquestracao>> {
    +analyze(source) : Program
    +compile(source, output) : bool
  }
  class "compile_file()" as CompileFile <<orquestracao>>
}

package "2. Front-end" {
  interface ILexico <<contrato>> {
    +initialize(source)
    +next_token() : Token
  }
  class Lexer <<frontend>> {
    +tokenize() : list[Token]
  }
  class Token <<frontend>> {
    +type : TokenType
    +lexeme : str
    +line, column : int
  }
  enum TokenType <<frontend>> {
    IDENTIFIER
    INT_LITERAL
    FLOAT_LITERAL
    STRING_LITERAL
    NEWLINE
    INDENT
    DEDENT
    END_OF_FILE
    ...
  }

  interface ISintatico <<contrato>> {
    +parse(lexer, semantic) : Program
  }
  class Parser <<frontend>> {
    +parse() : Program
  }
  class ASTNode <<frontend>> {
    +line, column : int
    +tipo_inferido : str
    +para_dict() : dict
  }
  class Program <<frontend>> {
    +statements : tuple[ASTNode, ...]
  }

  interface ISemantico <<contrato>> {
    +analyze(program) : bool
    +diagnostics : Sequence[Diagnostic]
  }
  class SemanticAnalyzer <<frontend>> {
    +analyze(program) : bool
    +diagnostics : Sequence[Diagnostic]
  }

  interface ITabelaSimbolos <<contrato>> {
    +enter_scope(name, reuse)
    +exit_scope()
    +define(symbol) : bool
    +lookup(name) : Symbol
    +export() : dict
  }
  class TabelaSimbolos <<frontend>> {
    +define(symbol) : bool
    +lookup(name) : Symbol
    +export() : dict
  }
  class Symbol <<frontend>> {
    +name : str
    +type : str
    +category : str
    +scope : str
  }

  class Diagnostic <<frontend>> {
    +phase : Phase
    +message : str
    +line, column : int
  }
  class DiagnosticBag <<frontend>> {
    +report(diagnostic)
    +has_errors : bool
    +format_text() : str
  }
}

package "3. Back-end" {
  interface IGeradorTAC <<contrato>> {
    +generate(program, output) : str
  }
  class TACGenerator <<backend>> {
    +generate_text(program) : str
    +generate(program, output) : str
  }
  class "TAC (.tac)" as TAC <<artefato>> {
    3 enderecos, em texto
  }

  interface IGeradorCpp <<contrato>> {
    +generate(tac, output) : bool
  }
  class CppCodeGenerator <<backend>> {
    +generate_source(tac) : str
    +generate(tac, output, nivel) : bool
  }
  class "C++ (.cpp)" as Cpp <<artefato>>

  class DriverGCC <<backend>> {
    +compile(cpp_path, output, nivel) : bool
    +executar(saida, args) : Result
  }
  class "Executavel" as Exe <<artefato>>
}

package "4. Runtime" {
  class MiniParChannel <<runtime>> {
    +enviar<T...>()
    +receber<T...>()
  }
  class "minipar_parallel()" as Parallel <<runtime>> {
    threads + core(N)
  }
  class Worker <<runtime>> {
    +main(porta)
  }
  class "minipar.hosts" as Hosts <<artefato>> {
    IP/porta por computador
  }
}

' ---- Orquestracao ----
CompiladorMiniPar ..> IControle : delega
CControle ..|> IControle

' ---- Front-end ----
Lexer ..> ILexico : segue
Lexer ..> Token : produz
Parser ..> ISintatico : segue
Parser ..> Token : consome
Parser ..> Program : produz
Program *-- "0..*" ASTNode : compoe
SemanticAnalyzer ..> ISemantico : segue
SemanticAnalyzer ..> Program : analisa
SemanticAnalyzer *-- TabelaSimbolos
SemanticAnalyzer ..> DiagnosticBag : reporta
TabelaSimbolos ..|> ITabelaSimbolos
TabelaSimbolos o-- "0..*" Symbol : armazena
DiagnosticBag o-- "0..*" Diagnostic : acumula
Token --> TokenType : type

' ---- Back-end ----
TACGenerator ..> IGeradorTAC : segue
TACGenerator ..> Program : consome
TACGenerator ..> TAC : grava
CppCodeGenerator ..> IGeradorCpp : segue
CppCodeGenerator ..> TAC : consome
CppCodeGenerator ..> Cpp : grava
CppCodeGenerator ..> DriverGCC : aciona
DriverGCC ..> Exe

' ---- Runtime ----
Exe ..> MiniParChannel : canais TCP
Exe ..> Parallel : core(N)
Exe ..> Worker : host("...")
Worker ..> Hosts : le

note bottom of CompileFile
  Fluxo concreto do CLI: instancia
  Lexer, Parser, SemanticAnalyzer,
  TACGenerator e CppCodeGenerator
  em sequencia (main.py / cli.py).
end note

note right of IControle
  Contratos ABC: CControle recebe
  as fases por injecao (ILexico,
  ISintatico, ISemantico, IGeradorTAC,
  IGeradorCpp), o que permite fakes
  nos testes.
  --
  No codigo atual, so TabelaSimbolos
  herda de ITabelaSimbolos; as demais
  classes cumprem o contrato por
  tipagem estrutural (duck typing).
end note

note bottom of DiagnosticBag
  Um unico DiagnosticBag atravessa
  lexico, sintatico e semantico,
  com linha e coluna.
end note

' mantem as camadas na ordem do pipeline
"1. Orquestracao" -[hidden]down-> "2. Front-end"
"2. Front-end" -[hidden]down-> "3. Back-end"
"3. Back-end" -[hidden]down-> "4. Runtime"

legend right
  Cores por camada:
  azul    orquestracao (controle)
  verde   front-end (analises)
  laranja back-end (TAC, C++, GCC)
  lilas   runtime de execucao
  amarelo contratos ABC
  cinza   artefatos gerados
  --
  Pipeline: .mp -> Token[] -> Program (AST)
  -> TabelaSimbolos + DiagnosticBag
  -> .tac -> .cpp -> executavel
  --
  TAC hoje e texto; instrucoes tipadas
  (InstrucaoTAC) sao plano futuro
  (tac_planejado.puml).
endlegend

@enduml
